content.content:
{"result":"{
  "id": "19321",
  "key": "SFCC-823",
  "summary": "Country Mismatch Slide-Out",
  "description": "As a Shopper, \n\nI want to be prompted when I appear to be visiting from a different region than the storefront I've landed on, \n\nso that I can easily navigate to the correct Zimmermann storefront for my location.\n\n----\n\nOn first visit, if the shopper's IP-detected country does not match the current storefront's shipping region, a slide-out prompt is displayed informing them of the mismatch. The shopper can act on it or dismiss it. The AU storefront is excluded — it is gated at IP level (SFCC-817) and never shows the slide-out. The underlying PWA component (global/country-mismatch-prompt) is built in the PWA Kit Components epic; this story covers the trigger logic, behaviour, and rules from the shopper's perspective.\n\n**Image for reference (Figma is leading):**\n\n![\"image-20260827-024636.png\"](image-20260827-024636.png)",
  "status": {
    "name": "Blocked",
    "category": "In Progress",
    "color": "yellow"
  },
  "labels": [
    "Custom",
    "REG-014",
    "REG-015",
    "REG-016",
    "REG-017",
    "REG-018",
    "REG-019",
    "Squad-A"
  ],
  "comments": [
    {
      "id": "14200",
      "body": "Hi User:5cc71886cbbec211ec62929d \n\nWhen you say that a shopper arrives on the website for the first time - is this based on cookies / caching and will retrigger based on the rules around them?\n\nBest,\n\nEmma",
      "author": {
        "display_name": "Emma Kirwan",
        "name": "Emma Kirwan",
        "email": null,
        "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/437c30dd63bbb0ec0a2f7c0d8d556d93?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FEK-4.png"
      },
      "created": "2026-09-01T21:43:29.628+1000",
      "updated": "2026-09-01T21:43:29.628+1000"
    },
    {
      "id": "14216",
      "body": "User:712020:c99d37b3-9c93-4347-951d-5ffb32ff1341 Hi Emma, true, should be cookie-based. When the slide-out is dismissed or acted on, a cookie is set so the shopper isn't prompted again immediately. Miraal told me from discovery she remembered it was set for 7 days and then expired? Can you confirm the requirements:\nProposed additional ACs (also for [SFCC-689](https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-689) but adjusted for language mismatch): \n\\*\\*Given\\*\\* a shopper dismisses or acts on the country mismatch slide-out\n\\*\\*When\\*\\* the interaction is complete\n\\*\\*Then\\*\\* a required functional cookie is set in the shopper's browser suppressing the slide-out for 7 days\n\\*\\*Given\\*\\* the cookie has been set\n\\*\\*When\\*\\* the shopper returns to the site within 7 days\n\\*\\*Then\\*\\* the country mismatch slide-out is not shown, regardless of IP/country mismatch\n\\*\\*Given\\*\\* the cookie has expired (after 7 days)\n\\*\\*When\\*\\* the shopper returns to the site and their IP-detected country still does not match the storefront's shipping region\n\\*\\*Then\\*\\* the country mismatch slide-out is shown again\n\\*\\*Given\\*\\* the shopper clears their browser cookies\n\\*\\*When\\*\\* they return to the site and their IP-detected country does not match the storefront's shipping region\n\\*\\*Then\\*\\* the country mismatch slide-out is shown again, as no suppression cookie is present",
      "author": {
        "display_name": "Jasmijn Tsang",
        "name": "Jasmijn Tsang",
        "email": "jasmijn.tsang@accenture.com",
        "avatar_url": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/5cc71886cbbec211ec62929d/40fcd533-06f6-4e5b-ba9f-23879e1193f9/48"
      },
      "created": "2026-09-02T15:39:38.909+1000",
      "updated": "2026-09-02T15:39:38.909+1000"
    },
    {
      "id": "14221",
      "body": "Hi User:5cc71886cbbec211ec62929d \n\nThe I am happy with the additional ACs below for this ( SFCC-823 ) and [SFCC-689](https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-689). I need to confirm the the number of days that the cookie is stored for so its probably X days until confirmed otherwise.\n\nIf you add these I will sign off the tickets.",
      "author": {
        "display_name": "Emma Kirwan",
        "name": "Emma Kirwan",
        "email": null,
        "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/437c30dd63bbb0ec0a2f7c0d8d556d93?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FEK-4.png"
      },
      "created": "2026-09-02T20:36:34.429+1000",
      "updated": "2026-09-02T20:37:04.650+1000"
    },
    {
      "id": "14235",
      "body": "User:712020:c99d37b3-9c93-4347-951d-5ffb32ff1341 Updated. I wrote that we could start with 7 but that it can be updated. Any idea on when you can get it confirmed?",
      "author": {
        "display_name": "Jasmijn Tsang",
        "name": "Jasmijn Tsang",
        "email": "jasmijn.tsang@accenture.com",
        "avatar_url": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/5cc71886cbbec211ec62929d/40fcd533-06f6-4e5b-ba9f-23879e1193f9/48"
      },
      "created": "2026-09-03T11:41:56.729+1000",
      "updated": "2026-09-03T11:41:56.729+1000"
    },
    {
      "id": "14267",
      "body": "Hi User:5cc71886cbbec211ec62929d this is PO approved",
      "author": {
        "display_name": "Emma Kirwan",
        "name": "Emma Kirwan",
        "email": null,
        "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/437c30dd63bbb0ec0a2f7c0d8d556d93?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FEK-4.png"
      },
      "created": "2026-09-03T17:22:20.038+1000",
      "updated": "2026-09-03T17:22:20.038+1000"
    },
    {
      "id": "14420",
      "body": "User:623a4c25562ab90069f7e510  can you confirm that the link in the design field is the final approved version?",
      "author": {
        "display_name": "Hazel Marie Cacalda",
        "name": "Hazel Marie Cacalda",
        "email": "hazel.marie.i.banaz@accenture.com",
        "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/883ff1fae0c6179bdff495757469823d?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FHC-4.png"
      },
      "created": "2026-09-07T12:20:17.205+1000",
      "updated": "2026-09-07T12:20:17.205+1000"
    }
  ],
  "attachments": [
