41-// A cancelled/abandoned IDP round-trip has no reliable "the user said no" signal we can
42-// observe here — the callback route that owns the actual redirect-back is base SFCC code,
43-// not this hook. Bound the blast radius by age instead: long enough for a slow IDP
44-// round-trip, short enough that an abandoned attempt can't misfire a much later, unrelated
45-// registration in the same tab.
